    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Journey Timeline Block</strong> is a modern, fully customizable block plugin for the WordPress Block Editor. It helps you build vertical timeline sections to highlight key events like business growth, product launches, or personal milestones — all with an intuitive, responsive, and animation-ready UI.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re a business owner, freelancer, or agency, you can create professional-looking visual stories using two unique layouts:<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Minimal Milestone Timeline</strong>: Clean, dotted path with alternating items<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Modern Card Timeline</strong>: Stylish vertical cards on a solid path</p>\n<p>Easily manage your timeline using a simple backend interface with controls for content, styles, responsiveness, and animations. No coding required.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<p>🧩 <strong>Flexible Content Fields</strong><br />\n&#8211; Section Heading<br />\n&#8211; Milestone Title<br />\n&#8211; Year Label<br />\n&#8211; Description<br />\n&#8211; Image or Icon</p>\n<p>🎛️ <strong>Customizable Settings</strong><br />\n&#8211; Show/hide each field individually<br />\n&#8211; Typography control for heading, title, year, description<br />\n&#8211; Font size units: px, em, rem, vw<br />\n&#8211; Custom width, margin, and padding per breakpoint<br />\n&#8211; Media controls for image sizing<br />\n&#8211; Add custom CSS classes per block</p>\n<p>🖼️ <strong>Pre-Built Layouts</strong><br />\n&#8211; <strong>Minimal Milestone Timeline</strong> – Lightweight, alternating layout with dotted line<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Modern Card Timeline</strong> – Bold, centralized layout with colored cards and shadows</p>\n<p>📱 <strong>Responsive Design</strong><br />\n&#8211; Controls for desktop, tablet, and mobile<br />\n&#8211; Per-device spacing and font sizes<br />\n&#8211; Built with performance in mind</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>Smooth Animations</strong><br />\n&#8211; Built-in <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Motion One</a> animation support<br />\n&#8211; AOS (Animate on Scroll) integration for reveal effects</p>\n<p>🧠 <strong>User-Friendly Editing</strong><br />\n&#8211; Organized tabbed interface (General, Style, Advanced)<br />\n&#8211; Add or remove timeline items with ease<br />\n&#8211; Default starter item auto-added on block insert</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Plugin developed and maintained by <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/aimsinfosoft/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Aims Infosoft</a><br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"https://aimsinfosoft.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://aimsinfosoft.com</a></p>\n<p>Built using:<br />\n&#8211; WordPress Block Editor<br />\n&#8211; React<br />\n&#8211; Motion One<br />\n&#8211; AOS (Animate on Scroll Library)</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GNU General Public License v2.0 or later</a>.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> or install via the Plugins screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; screen.</li>\n<li>Edit any page or post using the WordPress Block Editor.</li>\n<li>Search for “<strong>Journey Timeline Block</strong>” in the block inserter.</li>\n<li>Insert and start customizing your timeline.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20the%20timeline%20block%20responsive%3F'>\nIs the timeline block responsive?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. All settings and elements are fully responsive with per-device controls.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20my%20own%20styles%20or%20css%3F'>\nCan I use my own styles or CSS?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can assign custom CSS classes to each block via the <strong>Advanced</strong> tab.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='are%20there%20animations%3F'>\nAre there animations?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The plugin includes <strong>Motion One</strong> and <strong>AOS</strong> animation options that can be customized per layout.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20layouts%20are%20included%3F'>\nHow many layouts are included?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Two layouts are currently available, with more planned in future updates.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20support%20wordpress%20themes%3F'>\nDoes it support WordPress themes?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. It works with all major WordPress themes that support the block editor.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release  </li>\n<li>Includes Minimal and Card timeline layouts  </li>\n<li>Full style customization via block settings  </li>\n<li>Responsive typography and layout controls  </li>\n<li>Motion One and AOS scroll animations  </li>\n<li>Default milestone item on block insert</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Showcase your company history, project phases, or brand milestones with beautiful, responsive timeline blocks built for the WordPress Block Editor.",
    "description": "<p><strong>Journey Timeline Block</strong> is a modern, fully customizable block plugin for the WordPress Block Editor. It helps you build vertical timeline sections to highlight key events like business growth, product launches, or personal milestones — all with an intuitive, responsive, and animation-ready UI.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re a business owner, freelancer, or agency, you can create professional-looking visual stories using two unique layouts:<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Minimal Milestone Timeline</strong>: Clean, dotted path with alternating items<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Modern Card Timeline</strong>: Stylish vertical cards on a solid path</p>\n<p>Easily manage your timeline using a simple backend interface with controls for content, styles, responsiveness, and animations. No coding required.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<p>🧩 <strong>Flexible Content Fields</strong><br />\n&#8211; Section Heading<br />\n&#8211; Milestone Title<br />\n&#8211; Year Label<br />\n&#8211; Description<br />\n&#8211; Image or Icon</p>\n<p>🎛️ <strong>Customizable Settings</strong><br />\n&#8211; Show/hide each field individually<br />\n&#8211; Typography control for heading, title, year, description<br />\n&#8211; Font size units: px, em, rem, vw<br />\n&#8211; Custom width, margin, and padding per breakpoint<br />\n&#8211; Media controls for image sizing<br />\n&#8211; Add custom CSS classes per block</p>\n<p>🖼️ <strong>Pre-Built Layouts</strong><br />\n&#8211; <strong>Minimal Milestone Timeline</strong> – Lightweight, alternating layout with dotted line<br />\n&#8211; <strong>Modern Card Timeline</strong> – Bold, centralized layout with colored cards and shadows</p>\n<p>📱 <strong>Responsive Design</strong><br />\n&#8211; Controls for desktop, tablet, and mobile<br />\n&#8211; Per-device spacing and font sizes<br />\n&#8211; Built with performance in mind</p>\n<p>✨ <strong>Smooth Animations</strong><br />\n&#8211; Built-in <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Motion One</a> animation support<br />\n&#8211; AOS (Animate on Scroll) integration for reveal effects</p>\n<p>🧠 <strong>User-Friendly Editing</strong><br />\n&#8211; Organized tabbed interface (General, Style, Advanced)<br />\n&#8211; Add or remove timeline items with ease<br />\n&#8211; Default starter item auto-added on block insert</p>\n<h3>Credits</h3>\n<p>Plugin developed and maintained by <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/aimsinfosoft/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Aims Infosoft</a><br />\nWebsite: <a href=\"https://aimsinfosoft.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://aimsinfosoft.com</a></p>\n<p>Built using:<br />\n&#8211; WordPress Block Editor<br />\n&#8211; React<br />\n&#8211; Motion One<br />\n&#8211; AOS (Animate on Scroll Library)</p>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the <a href=\"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GNU General Public License v2.0 or later</a>.</p>\n",
